				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>When the vehicle is in <term translate="no">ON</term> position, select <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Lights</uicontrol><uicontrol>Ambient Lighting</uicontrol></menucascade> from the infotainment system.</p>
		<note type="note" id="e01980">
			<p>The infotainment system may change after a software update. For more details, refer to the user’s manual in the infotainment system or the quick reference guide.</p>
		</note>
